{
  "title": "Dua before and after Ritual Prayers",
  "data": "Before & After the Prayer\nBefore starting the prayer, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَتَوَجَّهُ اِلَيْكَ بِمُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAWAJJAHU ILAYKA BIMUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, I turn towards You through Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَّاُقَدِّمُهُمْ بَيْنَ يَدَىْ صَلَوَاتِىْ وَاَتَقَرَّبُ بِهِمْ اِلَيْكَ\nWA UQADDIMUHUM BAYNA YADAY SALAWAATEE WA ATAQARRABU BIHIM ILAYK\nand I put them forward before my prayers, and seek nearness to You through them.\nفَاجْعَلْنِىْ بِهِمْ وَجِيْهًا فِى الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ وَمِنَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nFAJ'ALNEE BIHIM WAJEEHAN FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRATI WA MINAL MUQARRABEEN\nSo make me, through them, distinguished in this world and the Hereafter, and one of those brought near to You.\nمَنَنْتَ عَلَىَّ بِمَعْرِفَتِهِمْ\nMANANTA A'LAYYA BIMA'RIFATIHIM\nYou have favored me with knowing them;\nفَاخْتِمْ لِىْ بِطَاعَتِهِمْ وَمَعْرِفَتِهِمْ وَوِلَايَتِهِمْ فَاِنَّهَا السَّعَادَةُ\nFAKHTIM LEE BITAA'ATIHIM WA MA'RIFATIHIM WA WILAAYATIHIM FA-INNAHAS SA'AADAH\nso seal my life with obedience to them, knowledge of them and loyalty to them, for that is true felicity,\nوَاخْتِمْ لِىْ بِهَا فَاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْئٍ قَدِيْرٌ.\nWAKHTIM LEE BIHAA FA-INNAKA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nand seal my life with it, for You have power over all things.\nAfter finishing the prayer, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنِىْ مَعَ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ فِىْ كُلِّ عَافِيَةٍ وَبَلَاۤءٍ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'LNEE MA'A MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN FEE KULLI A'AFIYATIN WA BALAA'\nO Allah, place me with Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad in every well-being and every trial,\nوَاجْعَلْنِىْ مَعَ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ فِىْ كُلِّ مَثْوًى وَمُنْقَلَبٍ\nWAJ'ALNEE MA'A MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN FEE KULLI MATHWAN WA MUNQALAB\nand place me with Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad in every abode and every return.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْ مَحْيَاىَ مَحْيَاهُمْ وَمَمَاتِىْ مَمَاتَهُمْ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'L MAHYAAYA MAHYAAHUM WA MAMAATEE MAMAATAHUM\nO Allah, make my life as their life and my death as their death,\nوَاجْعَلْنِىْ مَعَهُمْ فِى الْمَوَاطِنِ كُلِّهَا\nWAJ'ALNEE MA'AHUM FIL MAWAATINI KULLIHAA\nplace me with them in every situation,\nوَلَا تُفَرِّقْ بَيْنِىْ وَبَيْنَهُمْ اِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ.\nWA LAA TUFARRIQ BAYNEE WA BAYNAHUM INNAKA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nand do not separate me from them; surely You have power over all things.",
  "tabs": [
    "Before the Opening Takbir\nFacing the qiblah, before the opening takbir of the prayer, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا تُؤْيِسْنِىْ مِنْ رَّوْحِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TU'YISNEE MIR RAWHIK\nO Allah, do not make me despair of Your solace,\nوَلَا تُقَنِّطْنِىْ مِنْ رَّحْمَتِكَ وَلَا تُؤْمِنِّىْ مَكْرَكَ\nWA LAA TUQANNITNEE MIR RAHMATIKA WA LAA TU'MINNEE MAKRAK\nnor make me lose hope of Your mercy, nor make me feel secure from Your plan,\nفَاِنَّهٗ لَا يَاْمَنُ مَكْرَ اللّٰهِ اِلَّا الْقَوْمُ الْخَاسِرُوْنَ.\nFA-INNAHOO LAA YA'MANU MAKRALLAAHI ILLAL QAWMUL KHAASIROON\nfor none feels secure from Allah's plan except the people who are lost.",
    "After the Zuhr Prayer\nAfter the Zuhr prayer, recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِجُوْدِكَ وَكَرَمِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIJOODIKA WA KARAMIK\nO Allah, I seek nearness to You by Your generosity and nobility,\nوَاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِمُحَمَّدٍ عَبْدِكَ وَرَسُوْلِكَ\nWA ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIMUHAMMADIN A'BDIKA WA RASOOLIK\nand I seek nearness to You by Muhammad, Your servant and Messenger,\nوَاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِمَلَاۤئِكَتِكَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ وَاَنْبِيَاۤئِكَ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIMALAA'IKATIKAL MUQARRABEENA WA ANBIYAA'IKAL MURSALEEN\nand I seek nearness to You by Your angels brought near and Your prophets sent as messengers,\nوَبِكَ اللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ الْغَنِىُّ عَنِّىْ وَبِىَ الْفَاقَةُ اِلَيْكَ\nWA BIKALLAAHUMMA ANTAL GHANIYYU A'NNEE WA BIYAL FAAQATU ILAYK\nand by You. O Allah, You have no need of me, while I am in want of You.\nاَنْتَ الْغَنِىُّ عَنِّىْ وَاَنَا الْفَقِيْرُ اِلَيْكَ\nANTAL GHANIYYU A'NNEE WA ANAL FAQEERU ILAYK\nYou have no need of me, and I am the one in need of You.\nاَقَلْتَنِىْ عَثْرَتِىْ وَسَتَرْتَ عَلَىَّ ذُنُوْبِىْ\nAQALTANEE A'THRATEE WA SATARTA A'LAYYA DHUNOOBEE\nYou have overlooked my slip and covered my sins;\nفَاقْضِ الْيَوْمَ حَاجَتِىْ وَلَا تُعَذِّبْنِىْ بِقَبِيْحِ مَا تَعْلَمُ مِنِّىْ\nFAQDIL YAWMA HAAJATEE WA LAA TU'ADHDHIBNEE BIQABEEHI MAA TA'LAMU MINNEE\nso fulfil my need today, and do not punish me for the ugly deeds You know of me;\nبَلْ عَفْوُكَ وَجُوْدُكَ يَسَعُنِىْ.\nBAL A'FWUKA WA JOODUKA YASA'UNEE\nrather, Your pardon and Your generosity embrace me.\nThen prostrate and recite:\nيَا اَهْلَ التَّقْوٰى وَيَا اَهْلَ الْمَغْفِرَةِ\nYAA AHLAT TAQWAA WA YAA AHLAL MAGHFIRAH\nO Source of piety, O Source of forgiveness,\nيَا بَرُّ يَا رَحِيْمُ\nYAA BARRU YAA RAHEEM\nO All-Benign, O All-Merciful!\nاَنْتَ اَبَرُّ بِىْ مِنْ اَبِىْ وَاُمِّىْ وَمِنْ جَمِيْعِ الْخَلَايِقِ\nANTA ABARRU BEE MIN ABEE WA UMMEE WA MIN JAMEE'IL KHALAAYIQ\nYou are kinder to me than my father and my mother and all creatures.\nاِقْلِبْنِىْ بِقَضَاۤءِ حَاجَتِىْ مُجَابًا دُعَاۤئِىْ مَرْحُوْمًا صَوْتِىْ\nIQLIBNEE BIQADAA'I HAAJATEE MUJAABAN DU'AA'EE MARHOOMAN SAWTEE\nSend me back with my need fulfilled, my supplication answered and my voice shown mercy,\nقَدْ كَشَفْتَ اَنْوَاعَ الْبَلَاۤءِ عَنِّىْ.\nQAD KASHAFTA ANWAA'AL BALAA'I A'NNEE\nhaving lifted all kinds of affliction from me.",
    "Dua of Imam al-Taqi (a.s.)\nWhen you finish an obligatory prayer, recite:\nرَضِيْتُ بِاللّٰهِ رَبًّا وَبِمُحَمَّدٍ نَبِيًّا\nRADEETU BILLAAHI RABBAN WA BIMUHAMMADIN NABIYYAA\nI am pleased with Allah as Lord and with Muhammad as Prophet,\nوَبِالْاِسْلَامِ دِيْنًا وَبِالْقُرْاٰنِ كِتَابًا\nWA BIL ISLAAMI DEENAN WA BIL QUR'AANI KITAABAA\nwith Islam as religion and with the Qur'an as Book,\nوَبِفُلَانٍ وَفُلَانٍ اَئِمَّةً\nWA BIFULAANIN WA FULAANIN A'IMMAH\nand with so-and-so and so-and-so (naming the Imams) as Imams.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَلِيُّكَ فُلَانٌ فَاحْفَظْهُ مِنْ بَيْنِ يَدَيْهِ وَمِنْ خَلْفِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA WALIYYUKA FULAANUN FAHFAZHU MIN BAYNI YADAYHI WA MIN KHALFIH\nO Allah, Your friend so-and-so (naming the Imam of the time): guard him from before him and from behind him,\nوَعَنْ يَمِيْنِهٖ وَعَنْ شِمَالِهِ وَمِنْ فَوْقِهٖ وَمِنْ تَحْتِهٖ\nWA A'N YAMEENIHEE WA A'N SHIMAALIHEE WA MIN FAWQIHEE WA MIN TAHTIH\nfrom his right and from his left, from above him and from beneath him.\nوَامْدُدْ لَهٗ فِىْ عُمْرِهٖ وَاجْعَلْهُ الْقَاۤئِمَ بِاَمْرِكَ وَالْمُنْتَصِرَ لِدِيْنِكَ\nWAMDUD LAHOO FEE U'MRIHEE WAJ'ALHUL QAA'IMA BI-AMRIKA WAL MUNTASIRA LIDEENIK\nProlong his life, and make him the one who carries out Your command and the champion of Your religion.\nوَاَرِهٖ مَا يُحِبُّ وَمَا تَقِرُّ بِهٖ عَيْنُهٗ\nWA ARIHEE MAA YUHIBBU WA MAA TAQIRRU BIHEE A'YNUH\nShow him what he loves and what delights his eye\nفِىْ نَفْسِهٖ وَذُرِّيَّتِهٖ وَفِىْ اَهْلِهٖ وَمَالِهِ وَفِىْ شِيْعَتِهٖ وَفِىْ عَدُوِّهٖ\nFEE NAFSIHEE WA DHURRIYYATIHEE WA FEE AHLIHEE WA MAALIHEE WA FEE SHEE'ATIHEE WA FEE A'DUWWIH\nin himself and his offspring, in his family and his wealth, in his followers and in his enemy.\nوَاَرِهِمْ مِنْهُ مَا يَحْذَرُوْنَ\nWA ARIHIM MINHU MAA YAHDHAROON\nShow them from him what they dread,\nوَاَرِهٖ فِيْهِمْ مَّا يُحِبُّ وَتَقِرُّ بِهٖ عَيْنُهٗ\nWA ARIHEE FEEHIM MAA YUHIBBU WA TAQIRRU BIHEE A'YNUH\nand show him in them what he loves and what delights his eye,\nوَاشْفِ صُدُوْرَنا وَصُدُوْرَ قَوْمٍ مُّؤْمِنِيْنَ.\nWASHFI SUDOORANAA WA SUDOORA QAWMIM MU'MINEEN\nand heal our hearts and the hearts of a believing people.",
    "Dua of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)\nThe Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) would recite this after every obligatory prayer:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِىْ مَا قَدَّمْتُ وَمَا اَخَّرْتُ وَمَا اَسْرَرْتُ وَمَا اَعْلَنْتُ وَاِسْرَافِىْ عَلٰى نَفْسِىْ وَمَا اَنْتَ اَعْلَمُ بِهٖ مِنِّىْ\nALLAAHUMMAGH FIR LEE MAA QADDAMTU WA MAA AKHKHARTU WA MAA ASRARTU WA MAA A'LANTU WA ISRAAFEE A'LAA NAFSEE WA MAA ANTA A'LAMU BIHEE MINNEE\nO Allah, forgive me what I have sent ahead and what I have left behind, what I have hidden and what I have made public, my excess against myself, and what You know better than I do.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ الْمُقَدِّمُ وَالْمُؤَخِّرُ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTAL MUQADDIMU WAL MU'AKHKHIRU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANT\nO Allah, You are the One Who brings forward and the One Who holds back; there is no god but You.\nبِعِلْمِكَ الْغَيْبَ وَبِقُدْرَتِكَ عَلَى الْخَلْقِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ\nBI-I'LMIKAL GHAYBA WA BIQUDRATIKA A'LAL KHALQI AJMA'EEN\nBy Your knowledge of the unseen and Your power over all creation,\nمَا عَلِمْتَ الْحَيٰوةَ خَيْرًا لِىْ فَاَحْيِنِىْ وَتَوَفَّنِىْ اِذَا عَلِمْتَ الْوَفَاةَ خَيْرًا لِّىْ\nMAA A'LIMTAL HAYAATA KHAYRAN LEE FA-AHYINEE WA TAWAFFANEE IDHAA A'LIMTAL WAFAATA KHAYRAL LEE\nkeep me alive as long as You know life is better for me, and take me when You know death is better for me.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ خَشْيَتَكَ فِى السِّرِّ وَالْعَلَانِيَةِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA KHASHYATAKA FIS SIRRI WAL A'LAANIYAH\nO Allah, I ask You for awe of You in private and in public,\nوَكَلِمَةَ الْحَقِّ فِى الْغَضَبِ وَالرِّضَا\nWA KALIMATAL HAQQI FIL GHADABI WAR RIDAA\nfor the word of truth in anger and in contentment,\nوَالْقَصْدَ فِى الْفَقْرِ وَالْغِنَا\nWAL QASDA FIL FAQRI WAL GHINAA\nand for moderation in poverty and in wealth.\nوَاَسْئَلُكَ نَعِيْمًا لَا يَنْفَدُ وَقُرَّةَ عَيْنٍ لَّا تَنْقَطِعُ\nWA AS'ALUKA NA'EEMAN LAA YANFADU WA QURRATA A'YNIL LAA TANQATI'\nI ask You for a bliss that never runs out and a delight of the eye that never ends.\nوَاَسْئَلُكَ الرِّضَا بِالْقَضَاۤءِ\nWA AS'ALUKAR RIDAA BIL QADAA'\nI ask You for contentment with Your decree,\nوَبَرَكَةَ الْمَوْتِ بَعْدَ الْعَيْشِ وَبَرْدَ الْعَيْشِ بَعْدَ الْمَوْتِ،\nWA BARAKATAL MAWTI BA'DAL A'YSHI WA BARDAL A'YSHI BA'DAL MAWT\nfor blessing in death after life, and for ease of life after death,\nوَلَذَّةَ الْمَنْظَرِ اِلٰى وَجْهِكَ وَشَوْقًا اِلٰى رُؤْيَتِكَ وَلِقَاۤئِكَ\nWA LADHDHATAL MANZARI ILAA WAJHIKA WA SHAWQAN ILAA RU'YATIKA WA LIQAA'IK\nfor the delight of gazing at Your Face, and for longing to see You and meet You,\nمِنْ غَيْرِ ضَرَّاۤءَ مُضِرَّةٍ وَلَا فِتْنَةٍ مُضِلَّةٍ\nMIN GHAYRI DARRAA'A MUDIRRATIN WA LAA FITNATIN MUDILLAH\nwithout harmful hardship or misleading trial.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ زَيِّنَّا بِزِيْنَةِ الْاِيْمَانِ وَاجْعَلْنَا هُدَاةً مُهْتَدِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA ZAYYINNAA BIZEENATIL EEMAANI WAJ'ALNAA HUDAATAN MUHTADEEN\nO Allah, adorn us with the adornment of faith, and make us guides who are rightly guided.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اهْدِنَا فِيْمَنْ هَدَيْتَ\nALLAAHUMMAH DINAA FEEMAN HADAYT\nO Allah, guide us among those You have guided.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ عَزِيْمَةَ الرَّشَادِ وَالثَّبَاتَ فِى الْاَمْرِ وَالرُّشْدَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA A'ZEEMATAR RASHAADI WATH THABAATA FIL AMRI WAR RUSHD\nO Allah, I ask You for resolve in right conduct, firmness in the matter, and right guidance.\nوَاَسْئَلُكَ شُكْرَ نِعْمَتِكَ وَحُسْنَ عَافِيَتِكَ وَاَدَاۤءَ حَقِّكَ\nWA AS'ALUKA SHUKRA NI'MATIKA WA HUSNA A'AFIYATIKA WA ADAA'A HAQQIK\nI ask You for gratitude for Your blessing, the beauty of Your well-being, and the fulfilment of Your right.\nوَاَسْئَلُكَ يَا رَبِّ قَلْبًا سَلِيْمًا وَلِسَانًا صَادِقًا\nWA AS'ALUKA YAA RABBI QALBAN SALEEMAN WA LISAANAN SAADIQAA\nI ask You, O my Lord, for a sound heart and a truthful tongue.\nوَاَسْتَغْفِرُكَ لِمَا تَعْلَمُ وَاَسْئَلُكَ خَيْرَ مَا تَعْلَمُ وَاَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ مَا تَعْلَمُ\nWA ASTAGHFIRUKA LIMAA TA'LAMU WA AS'ALUKA KHAYRA MAA TA'LAMU WA A'OODHU BIKA MIN SHARRI MAA TA'LAM\nI seek Your forgiveness for what You know, I ask You for the good of what You know, and I seek refuge in You from the evil of what You know.\nفَاِنَّكَ تَعْلَمُ وَلَا نَعْلَمُ وَاَنْتَ عَلَّامُ الْغُيُوْبِ.\nFA-INNAKA TA'LAMU WA LAA NA'LAMU WA ANTA A'LLAAMUL GHUYOOB\nFor You know and we do not know, and You are the Knower of all things unseen.",
    "Protection for Self, Family & Home\nAfter every obligatory prayer, recite:\nاُجِيْرُ نَفْسِىْ وَمَالِىْ وَوَلَدِىْ وَاَهْلِىْ وَدَارِىْ وَكُلَّ مَا هُوَ مِنِّىْ\nUJEERU NAFSEE WA MAALEE WA WALADEE WA AHLEE WA DAAREE WA KULLA MAA HUWA MINNEE\nI place myself, my wealth, my children, my family, my house and all that is mine under the protection\nبِاللّٰهِ الْوَاحِدِ الْاَحَدِ الصَّمَدِ\nBILLAAHIL WAAHIDIL AHADIS SAMAD\nof Allah, the One, the Unique, the Self-Sufficient,\nالَّذِىْ لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُوْلَدْ وَلَمْ يَكُنْ لَّهٗ كُفُوًا اَحَدٌ\nALLADHEE LAM YALID WA LAM YOOLAD WA LAM YAKUL LAHOO KUFUWAN AHAD\nWho begets not, nor is He begotten, and there is none like Him.\nوَاُجِيْرُ نَفْسِىْ وَمَالِىْ وَوَلَدِىْ وَكُلَّ مَا هُوَ مِنِّىْ بِرَبِّ الْفَلَقِ\nWA UJEERU NAFSEE WA MAALEE WA WALADEE WA KULLA MAA HUWA MINNEE BIRABBIL FALAQ\nI place myself, my wealth, my children and all that is mine under the protection of the Lord of the daybreak,\nمِنْ شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ وَمِنْ شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ اِذَا وَقَبَ\nMIN SHARRI MAA KHALAQA WA MIN SHARRI GHAASIQIN IDHAA WAQAB\nfrom the evil of what He has created, and from the evil of the darkness when it gathers,\nوَمِنْ شَرِّ النَّفَّاثَاتِ فِي الْعُقَدِ وَمِنْ شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ اِذَا حَسَدَ\nWA MIN SHARRIN NAFFAATHAATI FIL U'QADI WA MIN SHARRI HAASIDIN IDHAA HASAD\nfrom the evil of those who blow on knots, and from the evil of the envier when he envies.\nوَاُجِيْرُ نَفْسِىْ وَمَالِىْ وَوَلَدِىْ وَكُلَّ مَا هُوَ مِنِّىْ بِرَبِّ النَّاسِ مَلِكِ النَّاسِ اِلٰهِ النَّاسِ\nWA UJEERU NAFSEE WA MAALEE WA WALADEE WA KULLA MAA HUWA MINNEE BIRABBIN NAASI MALIKIN NAASI ILAAHIN NAAS\nI place myself, my wealth, my children and all that is mine under the protection of the Lord of mankind, the King of mankind, the God of mankind,\nمِنْ شَرِّ الْوَسْوَاسِ الْخَنَّاسِ الَّذِيْ يُوَسْوِسُ فِيْ صُدُوْرِ النَّاسِ مِنَ الْجِنَّةِ وَالنَّاسِ\nMIN SHARRIL WASWAASIL KHANNAASIL LADHEE YUWASWISU FEE SUDOORIN NAASI MINAL JINNATI WAN NAAS\nfrom the evil of the slinking whisperer, who whispers into the hearts of mankind, from among the jinn and mankind.\nوَاُجِيْرُ نَفْسِىْ وَمَالِىْ وَوَلَدِىْ وَكُلَّ مَا هُوَ مِنِّىْ بِاللّٰهِ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ الْحَىُّ الْقَيُّوْمُ\nWA UJEERU NAFSEE WA MAALEE WA WALADEE WA KULLA MAA HUWA MINNEE BILLAAHI LAA ILAAHA ILLAA HUWAL HAYYUL QAYYOOM\nI place myself, my wealth, my children and all that is mine under the protection of Allah; there is no god but He, the Ever-Living, the Self-Subsisting.\nلَا تَاْخُذُهٗ سِنَةٌ وَّلَا نَوْمٌ لَّهٗ مَا فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَمَا فِي الْاَرْضِ ۗ\nLAA TA'KHUDHUHOO SINATUN WA LAA NAWMUL LAHOO MAA FIS SAMAAWAATI WA MAA FIL ARD\nNeither slumber overtakes Him nor sleep; to Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth.\nمَنْ ذَا الَّذِيْ يَشْفَعُ عِنْدَهٗ اِلَّا بِاِذْنِهٖ ۚ يَعْلَمُ مَا بَيْنَ اَيْدِيهِمْ وَمَا خَلْفَهُمْ ۖ\nMAN DHAL LADHEE YASHFA'U I'NDAHOO ILLAA BI-IDHNIHEE YA'LAMU MAA BAYNA AYDEEHIM WA MAA KHALFAHUM\nWho is there that can intercede with Him except by His permission? He knows what is before them and what is behind them,\nوَلَا يُحِيْطُوْنَ بِشَيْءٍ مِّنْ عِلْمِهٖ اِلَّا بِمَا شَاۤءَ ۚ\nWA LAA YUHEETOONA BISHAY'IM MIN I'LMIHEE ILLAA BIMAA SHAA'\nand they encompass nothing of His knowledge except what He wills.\nوَسِعَ كُرْسِيُّهُ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْاَرْضَ ۖ وَلَا يَئُوْدُهٗ حِفْظُهُمَا ۚ وَهُوَ الْعَلِيُّ الْعَظِيْمُ.\nWA SI'A KURSIYYUHUS SAMAAWAATI WAL ARDA WA LAA YA'OODUHOO HIFZUHUMAA WA HUWAL A'LIYYUL A'ZEEM\nHis Throne extends over the heavens and the earth, and preserving them does not tire Him; He is the Most High, the Most Great."
